  "pages": 9
 },
 "summary": "The 2N3904 is a small-signal NPN bipolar transistor in a three-lead TO-92 body, for amplifier and switch duty. It blocks 40 V collector to emitter, carries 200 mA continuous, and has an hFE of 100 to 300 at 10 mA with fT of at least 300 MHz. 2N3904BU ships 10000 to a bulk bag; 2N3904TA and TAR ship 2000 on fan-fold, TF and TFR 2000 on tape and reel, all in TO-92-3 LF.",
