 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Use",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "A small-signal NPN transistor for both amplifying and switching. Its useful range reaches 100 mA of collector current as a switch and 100 MHz as an amplifier."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Power derating",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "In TO-92 the transistor may dissipate 625 mW with the ambient at 25 °C. Above that the allowance falls by 5.0 mW for each degree, reaching zero at 150 °C (Figure 10)."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Pulsed measurement",
   "page": 2,
